Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value VRF (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Interface\s+IP-Address\s+Status\s+Protocol -> Interfaces
  # Skip prompt, timestamp and any other preamble
  ^.* -> Start

Interfaces
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${STATUS}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${VRF}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${STATUS}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*\S+#
  ^. -> Error
